{"4603880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "We Die Standing", "steam_appid": 4603880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to We Die Standing.</strong><i> It </i>is a heavy, tactical sci-fi shooter where gravity is broken and survival is earned. Jump into the brutal, fast-paced <strong>Free-to-Play Multiplayer</strong>, or purchase the <strong>Premium Campaign DLC</strong> to experience the relentless, story-driven fight for survival at ground zero of a spatial cataclysm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-to-Play Multiplayer: Tactical &amp; Unforgiving</strong> Step into the heavy plating of a Praetorian and take the fight online. This isn't a nimble arena shooter—you are walking artillery. Feel the physical weight of your armor as you chain together heavy gunfire, savage melee executions, and tactical gear deployments. When the environment fractures and gravity fails, fire up your thrusters and take the firefight to zero-G. Use vertical space to outmaneuver your enemies and dominate the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Campaign (Premium DLC): Into the Cataclysm</strong> An event known only as &quot;The Rupture&quot; has torn a classified research sector apart. As a Praetorian trapped at the epicenter, your only way out is straight through the nightmare. Purchase the Campaign DLC to push your way through a relentless, story-driven single-player experience. Piece together what triggered the disaster from the wreckage, data logs, and desperate survivors. No filler—just a focused, brutal push to the facility's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal, Heavy Gunplay:</strong> Feel the weight of every step and shot. Manage your ammo, use cover, and strike hard across both multiplayer arenas and the single-player story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weaponize Gravity:</strong> Seamlessly transition between heavy, grounded combat and zero-gravity firefights where the rules of engagement change completely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-to-Play Combat:</strong> Squad up or fight solo in heavy, tactical multiplayer matches that demand skill, aggression, and environmental awareness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Narrative (DLC):</strong> Scavenge the collapsing facility to upgrade your suit and weapons. Tweak your loadout to match your playstyle as you survive dynamic, high-stakes encounters.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to We Die Standing.</strong><i> It </i>is a heavy, tactical sci-fi shooter where gravity is broken and survival is earned. Jump into the brutal, fast-paced <strong>Free-to-Play Multiplayer</strong>, or purchase the <strong>Premium Campaign DLC</strong> to experience the relentless, story-driven fight for survival at ground zero of a spatial cataclysm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-to-Play Multiplayer: Tactical &amp; Unforgiving</strong> Step into the heavy plating of a Praetorian and take the fight online. This isn't a nimble arena shooter—you are walking artillery. Feel the physical weight of your armor as you chain together heavy gunfire, savage melee executions, and tactical gear deployments. When the environment fractures and gravity fails, fire up your thrusters and take the firefight to zero-G. Use vertical space to outmaneuver your enemies and dominate the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Campaign (Premium DLC): Into the Cataclysm</strong> An event known only as &quot;The Rupture&quot; has torn a classified research sector apart. As a Praetorian trapped at the epicenter, your only way out is straight through the nightmare. Purchase the Campaign DLC to push your way through a relentless, story-driven single-player experience. Piece together what triggered the disaster from the wreckage, data logs, and desperate survivors. No filler—just a focused, brutal push to the facility's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal, Heavy Gunplay:</strong> Feel the weight of every step and shot. Manage your ammo, use cover, and strike hard across both multiplayer arenas and the single-player story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weaponize Gravity:</strong> Seamlessly transition between heavy, grounded combat and zero-gravity firefights where the rules of engagement change completely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-to-Play Combat:</strong> Squad up or fight solo in heavy, tactical multiplayer matches that demand skill, aggression, and environmental awareness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Narrative (DLC):</strong> Scavenge the collapsing facility to upgrade your suit and weapons. Tweak your loadout to match your playstyle as you survive dynamic, high-stakes encounters.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Arcs, Rings, Power, Annihilation, Courage, Comradeship, Worlds, Earth, Humans, Creatures, Flood, Scourge, Starvation, Crisis. Through All, One Must Fight Unless He Dies Standing.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603880/00c872bfde2f37607ec5f6998d95e22edc4708fa/header.jpg?t=1785308435", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603880/65f35c4ed9257d38c52da4955a066b098ed85f87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785308435", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603880/65f35c4ed9257d38c52da4955a066b098ed85f87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=178530843